<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hot Topic Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hot Topic Inc.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Montgomery Securities analyst Alice Ruth said she initiated coverage of Hot Topic Inc, a mall-based retailer of music-influenced apparel and accessories for teens, with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Ruth said she expects the company to earn $0.58 a share in the fiscal year ending January 1997, and $0.80 the following year. Her 12-month target price is in the low 30s.</p>
</text>
